  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Freedom 76**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Never Squeal On Pusher**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Spinal Meningitis Got Me Down**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2011-09-02.mk41.lemosax.m10.flac2448** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 97 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2011-09-02.mk41.lemosax.m10.flac2448**: taped by Bean; transferred by Bean; source: Schoeps MK 41 >>> Schoeps KCY 250/5 >>> Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 >>> Darktrain Silver Interconnects >>> Sony PCM-M10 [@24 Bit/48 kHz;Line In] [1]. Also: Recorded with a Sony PCM-M10 recorder, line-in, at 24-bit/48 kHz, saving to a micro SD card; Transfer chain: SD card to HP Pavilion desktop, CD Wave for tracking and cue sheets, MP3Tag for tagging, output as 24/48 FLAC; Credited to Beats By Bean, Team Pittsburgh and Team Schoeps [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Sarah Bourque: [Revisit moe.downs 11-15 and the Festival’s Return to Snow Ridge](https://nysmusic.com/2017/06/22/revisit-moe-downs-11-15-prior-to-the-festivals-return-to-snow-ridge/) [3]\n- Fan art by Sarah Bourque: [Revisit moe.downs 11-15 and the Festival’s Return to Snow Ridge](https://nysmusic.com/2017/06/22/revisit-moe-downs-11-15-prior-to-the-festivals-return-to-snow-ridge/) [4]\n- Fan art by Sarah Bourque: [Revisit moe.downs 11-15 and the Festival’s Return to Snow Ridge](https://nysmusic.com/2017/06/22/revisit-moe-downs-11-15-prior-to-the-festivals-return-to-snow-ridge/) [5]",
